*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.2"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "TRONIC.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Tronic"
*Product: "(Mini Pocket Printer)"
*ModelName: "Tronic Mini Pocket Printer"
*ShortNickName: "Tronic Pocket"
*NickName: "Tronic Mini Pocket Printer 48mm (A2Y)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*VariablePaperSize: True
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0

*% Physical roll width is 48 mm @ 203 dpi = 384 px.
*% In PostScript points (1 pt = 1/72 in): 48 mm = 136.063 pt.
*% Default height is a short receipt strip so Windows/Notepad do not
*% compose onto A4/Letter.

*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/png application/pdf 0 imagetopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "image/jpeg application/pdf 0 imagetopdf"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/pdf 0 -"

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Roll48x80
*PageSize Roll48x80/48 x 80 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 226.772]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Roll48x120/48 x 120 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 340.157]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Roll48x200/48 x 200 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 566.929]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Roll48x400/48 x 400 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 1133.858]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Roll48x80
*PageRegion Roll48x80/48 x 80 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 226.772]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Roll48x120/48 x 120 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 340.157]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Roll48x200/48 x 200 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 566.929]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Roll48x400/48 x 400 mm: "<</PageSize[136.063 1133.858]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Roll48x80
*ImageableArea Roll48x80: "0 0 136.063 226.772"
*ImageableArea Roll48x120: "0 0 136.063 340.157"
*ImageableArea Roll48x200: "0 0 136.063 566.929"
*ImageableArea Roll48x400: "0 0 136.063 1133.858"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Roll48x80
*PaperDimension Roll48x80: "136.063 226.772"
*PaperDimension Roll48x120: "136.063 340.157"
*PaperDimension Roll48x200: "136.063 566.929"
*PaperDimension Roll48x400: "136.063 1133.858"

*% IPP / driverless helpers (PWG-ish custom names)
*cupsPageSizeName Roll48x80/48x80mm: "custom_48x80mm"
*cupsPageSizeName Roll48x120/48x120mm: "custom_48x120mm"
*cupsPageSizeName Roll48x200/48x200mm: "custom_48x200mm"
*cupsPageSizeName Roll48x400/48x400mm: "custom_48x400mm"

*OpenUI *Density/Print Density: PickOne
*DefaultDensity: 1
*Density 0/Light: ""
*Density 1/Medium: ""
*Density 2/Dark: ""
*CloseUI: *Density

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(1.05)" Standard ROM
*End
